bar("aroon","Aroon trend","trend","up > 70 and down < 30","up < down",{"up":"AROON_UP(high,25)","down":"AROON_DOWN(low,25)"},"Measure time since highs/lows | Long on persistent recent highs | Exit when downside becomes dominant")
