 ("bull_call_spread","Bull call vertical","Buy lower-strike call and sell higher-strike same-expiry call | Confirm debit, multiplier and max loss | Exit at fixed profit/loss/time rule or settle spread"),
 ("bear_put_spread","Bear put vertical","Buy higher-strike put and sell lower-strike same-expiry put | Confirm net debit and settlement | Exit/settle with both option legs marked"),
 ("iron_condor","Defined-risk iron condor","Sell OTM call/put and buy farther OTM wings at same expiry | Reserve max spread loss and fees | Manage/close all legs as a package; stress gap through wings and illiquid exits"),
 ("butterfly","Option butterfly","Buy one lower strike and one upper strike, sell two middle strikes with equal spacing and expiry | Verify settlement parity and debit | Test range forecast versus total multi-leg spreads and expiry payoff"),
 ("calendar_option","Vega-matched calendar spread","Compare same-strike near/far IV with forecast term structure | Buy relatively cheap expiry and short expensive expiry, matching vega within delta cap | Hedge delta, mark both maturities, exit before near expiry"),
 ("skew_risk_reversal","Delta-neutral skew risk reversal","Compare equal-delta put/call IV difference with lagged own-history distribution | Buy cheap side and sell rich side with delta hedge | Cap tail/collateral exposure; exit normalized skew or time stop"),
 ("gamma_scalp","Long-gamma delta rebalancing","Buy option gamma when expected realized variation supports premium and hedge costs | Rehedge delta at predeclared bands rather than future optimized intervals | Mark option theta, vega and discrete hedge PnL"),
 ("put_call_parity","Put-call-parity relative value","For each matching strike/expiry derive parity under correct linear/inverse settlement and rates | Compare executable bid/ask package values after all legs | Trade only funded accessible violations with matched expiry and settlement"),
 ("vol_dispersion","BTC-altcoin volatility dispersion","Estimate basket weights and implied correlations from available chains | Buy relatively cheap constituent variance and sell rich index/BTC proxy variance with hedge | Treat BTC proxy mismatch as residual basis risk; cap gamma/vega"),
