 ("lp_dynamic_range","Dynamic volatility-based LP range","Estimate volatility and expected fee revenue from past pool events | Select/rebalance range only if expected fees exceed gas and adverse-selection cost | Include LVR, range-exit inventory and failed gas transactions"),
 ("lp_delta_hedged","Delta-hedged LP position","Compute LP delta from current reserves/range | Offset delta in accessible hedge market at fixed bands | Evaluate net fee+LP+hedge PnL including funding, gas, IL/LVR and jumps"),
 ("stable_pool_lp","Stablecoin-pool liquidity","Select pool with verified coins and stress redemption assumptions | Allocate capped inventory and accrue actual fees/incentives | Mark all coins at executable prices during depeg; include pool imbalance and withdrawal limits"),
 ("lending_carry","Collateralized on-chain lending carry","Compare forward supply yield net of incentives dilution/gas to cash alternative | Supply capped token exposure to specified protocol | Mark token, accrued yield and withdrawal liquidity; account for utilization and bad debt"),
 ("yield_rotation","Risk-adjusted yield rotation","Rank net lending/staking yields after gas and protocol concentration using only available snapshots | Rotate only if incremental expected horizon income exceeds all switch costs | Hold minimum horizon and record changing reward-token price"),
 ("staking_hedged","Staking yield with market hedge","Stake base token; short matched derivative delta if accessible | Net staking yield minus funding/borrow, slashing, costs and unbonding exposure | Rebalance delta and roll hedge on fixed schedule"),
 ("dex_cex_arb","DEX-CEX executable-price arbitrage","Compare exact AMM swap output including fee/gas with executable CEX depth | Match notional only after slippage and latency buffer | Simulate chain confirmation, reorg/failure and CEX hedge fills"),
