 ("token_unlock","Known token-unlock supply shock","Load versioned vesting schedule known before event; unlock/freefloat ratio | Test pre-event hedge or post-event rebound as distinct frozen variants | Close fixed event windows; charge borrow/funding and account for schedule changes"),
