 ("etf_event","ETF approval/flow event","Use official decision/release timestamp and actual public flow release time | Trade only surprise component after availability; flow revisions remain versioned | Evaluate fixed1h/1d windows against BTC market return and news controls"),
 ("exploit_event","Hack/exploit risk response","Confirm affected contract/asset and official evidence | Test immediate reduce-risk rule using accessible prices after first_seen | Restore only on predefined resolution evidence; record false reports and non-fill outcomes"),
