 ("q_learning","Tabular Q-learning strategy selection","State encodes lagged regime, cash/position, prior actions and matured fee-net outcomes | Choose among registered strategies plus cash; update Q(s,a) only after action's reward has matured | Freeze exploratory policy for test segment; persist every update/reason and compare no-recall ablation","RL_TRADE FINRL RL_LIMITS"),
 ("context_bandit","Contextual bandit strategy allocation","Use context available now and select one registered expert/cash | Record chosen-action reward after full holding horizon, no invented rewards for unobserved live alternatives | Update LinUCB/Thompson model with propensity and matured outcomes; cap exploration budget","FINRL RL_TRADE RL_LIMITS"),
 ("ppo_policy","PPO bounded-allocation policy","Environment contains actual cash, positions, costs and trailing features | Train PPO only on prior market regimes with random seeds and turnover penalty | Freeze checkpoint for held-out replay, no online updates from future labels","FINRL FINRL_CRYPTO RL_LIMITS"),
 ("sac_policy","SAC continuous portfolio policy","Define bounded target-weight actions and executable next-observation fills | Train entropy-regularized critic/actor on past episodes with replay provenance | Freeze policy/normalizer for evaluation; model capital and liquidity constraints","FINRL FINRL_CRYPTO RL_LIMITS"),
 ("dqn_policy","DQN discrete allocation policy","Use cash/long/reduce discrete actions with a complete cash ledger | Train Q-network on past transitions, separate replay buffers by split | Evaluate frozen network prospectively with fees and no invalid action rewards","FINRL RL_LIMITS"),
 ("risk_meta_label","Meta-label primary signals","Freeze simple primary signal and construct entry candidates | Label candidates by fee-net triple-barrier outcomes known only after maturity | Fit acceptance/size model on training candidates with purge; apply to future candidates","ML_CLASS PBO"),
