 ("online_newton","Online Newton portfolio selection","Observe previous period price-relative vector x | Update damped ONS curvature/gradient of negative log(w dot x), project onto simplex with caps | Execute next weights after costs; compare equal weight and best-in-hindsight only as labeled comparator","ONS"),
 ("pamr","Passive-aggressive mean-reversion portfolio","Observe completed price-relative vector x and current weights w | loss=max(0,w dot x-epsilon); tau=loss/||x-mean(x)||^2 with fixed aggressiveness cap | Set w_new=project_simplex(w-tau*(x-mean(x))); trade next period with real costs","PAMR ONS"),
 ("retrieval_policy","BEAN evidence-retrieval strategy selection","Retrieve only experiment records finished before decision as_of, matching strategy/data/regime | Return supporting and contradictory outcomes with source ids and frozen formulas | Let tested selector rank candidates; no retrieved prose executes orders or edits strategy code","FINRL PBO DSR"),
