 ("double_bottom","Confirmed double-bottom pattern","Confirm local extrema only after k=3 right-side completed bars | Require two lows within2% separated5-50 bars and intervening neckline | Enter after later neckline breakout, stop below confirmed lows, time stop20 bars"),
