 ("head_shoulders","Confirmed head-and-shoulders","Use only pivots whose3-bar right confirmation has elapsed | Identify three peaks with middle highest and shoulders within5%, fit neckline through troughs | Short only on later neckline break with fixed stop/time horizon"),
 ("inverse_head_shoulders","Confirmed inverse head-and-shoulders","Confirm three troughs after3 later bars, middle lowest, outside lows within5% | Fit neckline through intervening peaks | Buy later neckline break; stop below right shoulder; no retrospective pivot entry"),
 ("triangle_break","Confirmed triangle consolidation","Use last3 confirmed descending highs and ascending lows from prior50 bars | Fit bounds with trailing OLS and require positive range/contraction | Buy subsequent upper-line breakout; stop opposite line or20-bar expiry"),
 ("flag_break","Measured flag continuation","Require prior10-bar rise exceeding3 ATR, then5-15-bar consolidation retracing less than50% | Freeze consolidation high/low using completed bars | Enter subsequent upside break; exit low or time stop"),
 ("fibonacci_retrace","Confirmed-swing Fibonacci retracement","Confirm swing low/high after3-bar pivot delay | Freeze retracement levels38.2%,50%,61.8% from that already-known swing | Test first later61.8% touch and confirmed rebound; stop beyond swing low, exit prior high or20 bars"),
 ("harmonic_abcd","Causally confirmed ABCD ratio pattern","Extract alternating confirmed pivots with fixed3-bar delay | Require predeclared BC/AB and CD/AB ratio tolerance using only confirmed segments | Trade reversal only after D confirmation, never at historical D low/high; freeze stop/time exit"),
 ("elliott_fsm","Finite-state swing-wave hypothesis","Define pivots by fixed ATR reversal with elapsed confirmation | Fit explicit5-wave state machine with no discretionary relabeling and frozen length/overlap constraints | Test next confirmed corrective/continuation signal; retain ambiguous classifications as missing"),
